        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Santa Bring My Baby Back (To Me), Elvis' Christmas Album\n- People: Elvis Presley\n- Companies: RCA Victor\n- Places: Radio Recorders in Hollywood\n\nFacts:\n- In October 1957, RCA Victor released Elvis' Christmas Album as a deluxe limited edition with catalog number LOC-1035.\n- Elvis' Christmas Album was the fourth studio album and first Christmas album by Elvis Presley.\n- Elvis' Christmas Album was recorded at Radio Recorders in Hollywood.\n- In 1957, RCA Victor released the song Santa Bring My Baby Back (To Me) on Elvis' Christmas Album.",
